      }
     ],
     "value": "Functions as a negative regulator of myocyte differentiation. May interact with both sarcoplasmic structural proteins and nuclear proteins to regulate gene expression during muscle development and in response to muscle stress"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      },
