       "id": "21737686"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "22016770"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with ID3; both proteins cooperate in myoblast differentiation (By similarity). Interacts with TTN/titin. Interacts (via ANK repeats) with TCAP; the interaction is direct. Interacts with TJP1 (via PDZ domains). Interacts with PML; the interaction is direct. Interacts with p53/TP53. Interacts with YBX1. Interacts with AKT2"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
  },
